  "tourOnUpdateSubtitle": "A “What's new” card on the first launch of a new version",
  "tour1Title": "Hi! This is Enitor",
  "tour1Body": "Tasks for the day, goals for a week, month, season and year, a schedule of classes and shifts. Let me show you around.",
  "tour2Title": "Calendar",
  "tour2Body": "Pick a day to see its tasks below. The dot under a date: green — all done, yellow — some, red — none. The button at the top right switches between month, 2 weeks and week.",
  "tour3Title": "Add a task",
  "tour3Body": "Title, time, estimate and tags. A task can repeat or be a counter — “5 of 10”.",
  "tour4Title": "The day's tasks",
  "tour4Body": "Tick what's done. The ⋮ menu of a task has the focus timer, actual time, moving and copying.",
  "tour5Title": "Day summary",
  "tour5Body": "Productivity is how many tasks are done. “On time” is how many beat their deadline. In settings the summary can be shown as bars.",
  "tour6Title": "Templates",
  "tour6Body": "Save a good day as a template and roll it out on any other day with one tap.",
  "tour7Title": "Tasks and schedule",
  "tour7Body": "The Schedule tab holds classes, shifts and workouts by the clock. You can take it from a calendar .ics file.",
  "tour8Title": "Goals",
  "tour8Body": "Goals for a week, month, season and year. Flip through periods with the arrows; unmet goals can be moved forward.",
  "tour9Title": "Stats",
  "tour9Body": "Productivity charts for any range, stats by tag and how accurately you estimate time.",
  "tour10Title": "Profile",
  "tour10Body": "Your streak, the weekly review, a year heatmap, achievements and records. The gear at the top opens settings.",
  "tour11Title": "Your devices",
  "tour11Body": "Sync tasks between your phone and laptop — over Wi-Fi or through your own server. Notifications and integrations are here too.",
  "tour12Title": "That's it",
  "tour12Body": "You can take the tour again here. The switch below decides whether to offer it after updates."
